OL,3,GNEWSA'Why can't the council just build
OL,4,Aus a new school?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils, parents and grandparents have
OL,7,Fmarched through a Borders town to show
OL,8,Ftheir frustration over further delays
OL,9,Fto plans for a new primary school.
OL,11,FAbout #15m was first earmarked for a
OL,12,Freplacement primary for Eyemouth in
OL,13,F2015 after education officers conceded
OL,14,Fthe current building was not fit for
OL,15,Fpurpose.
OL,17,FDisagreements over the location of the
OL,18,Fnew school, the Covid pandemic and,
OL,19,Fmore recently, a refusal by Scottish
OL,20,FBorders Council (SBC) to factor in
OL,21,Finflation to the building costs has
OL,22,Fhindered any progress.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
